  (text "ESTOP"
    (at 15.24 125.92 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 2.5 2.5) bold)
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "fbb0cb16-f543-5a32-bd5c-68473bcf255e"))
  (text "Hardware E-stop -> IBT-2 enable: ACT_EN (GPIO39) runs through the NC E-stop loop to Q_A; Q_B\ninverts again, so EN5 (IDC pins 3/4 = R_EN/L_EN) is high only while the loop is closed AND the\nESP drives ACT_EN. ESP reset / loop open -> EN5 low -> bridges off. Fit a wire bridge if no\nE-stop is used."
    (at 15.24 137.32 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.4 1.4))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "bb38aff4-6143-5d34-83f4-49dba816aa0c"))
